 2025-06-05","finding":"Child/Caregiver Ratio - Opening/Closing: At arrival time, the opening ratio was observed to exceed the ratio limit and includ infants in care for more than an hour.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026250889","violation_type_title":"Child/Caregiver Ratio - Opening/Closing (26 TAC §746.1615)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1369882-i20250529-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-603-a-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1369882-i20250529","date":"2025-05-29","original_code":"746.603(a)(4)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-06-04","finding":"Children's Records - Immunizations: One out of the six children's records monitored did not have an immunization record.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026371721","violation_type_title":"Children's Records - Immunizations (26 TAC §746.603(a)(4))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1369882-i20250529-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1309-e","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1369882-i20250529","date":"2025-05-29","original_code":"746.1309(e)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-07-14","finding":"Documented Annual Training- Required Content: Three out of the six staff records reviewed, did not have the required annual safety trainings.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026371722","violation_type_title":"Documented Annual Training- Required Content (26 TAC §746.1309(e))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1369882-i20250529-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3701","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1369882-i20250529","date":"2025-05-29","original_code":"746.3701","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-06-05","finding":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards: In the infant classroom, chemicals were o